                    <p className="text-xs text-slate-350 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
                      Deploy tactical disaster response plans for active agricultural calamity zones, assign multi-agency response teams (Extension Officers, Local NGOs, Agritech Volunteers), define active duty items, and track live evacuation, relief, and crop damage statistics.
                    </p>
